# Workflow action pinning

When editing `.github/workflows/`:

- **SHA-pin** security-critical actions with a version comment:
  `rustsec/audit-check`, `gitleaks/gitleaks-action`, `zizmorcore/zizmor-action`, `actions/delete-package-versions`, `aquasecurity/trivy-action`
- Others may use major tags; Dependabot keeps them current
- Follow existing zizmor ignore comments where unpinned is intentional (`dtolnay/rust-toolchain`, `taiki-e/install-action`)

Reason: supply-chain incidents (e.g. trivy, Mar 2026) — see CLAUDE.md § Action pinning.
